Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Method definition and implementation code block
   Replaced the parameter list and method-body implementation of `values` in their entirety.
   The original implementation included:

   * Method signature: define `values(self, *, include: Set[str]=None, exclude: Set[str]=set()) -> Dict[str, Any]`;
   * Return statement: return a dictionary comprehension generated by iterating over `self`, filtering keys according to `include` and `exclude`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Method signature: define `values(self, **kwargs)`;
   * Call statement: call `warnings.warn(...)` to issue a `DeprecationWarning`;
   * Return statement: return the result of `self.dict(**kwargs)`.
